 "caption_en": "Gyro or fins? 🌊 Two very different ways to stop your boat rolling. A = a spinning flywheel inside the hull, brilliant at anchor, nothing outside the hull. B = fins under the waterline, instant response and stronger the faster you go. Which would you fit? Comment A or B 👇",
